00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:17.760
It's actually worsening it.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.220
And I'll explain why.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.790
New audio report CNN.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.170
McCarthy said 25th Amendment takes too long.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:29.390
In other words, the 25th Amendment would take
too long to remove Trump he wanted as a Republican

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:35.100
