00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.570
This is incredible.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:44.420
House Republican leader Kevin McCarthy discussed
the 25th Amendment is a mechanism to remove

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:49.580
a sitting president on a call with Republican
leadership days after the January six, 2021

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:52.630
attack on the Capitol and said the process
takes too long.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:57.579
According to audio obtained by the New York
Times and shared with CNN, he also said he

00:00:57.579 --> 00:01:02.650
wanted to reach out to then President elect
Biden to hope for a smooth transition and

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:06.330
said he thought an impeachment would further
divide the nation.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.350
Let's listen to that audio revealed yesterday
to CNN by The New York Times reporters.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:13.150
This is incredible stuff.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:15.620
Speaker 2: Yeah.

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:16.620
It was atrocious and totally wrong.

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:17.620
I was down.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:18.620
We were 12 days away at one point, only good
bye.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:23.850
If you have an impeachment and you're stuck
sitting in the Senate and he needs Cabinet

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:28.391
members, you've got senators and you've got
a lot of fans, you've got to have them.

00:01:28.391 --> 00:01:29.391
And from their perspective, you've put everything
else away.

00:01:29.391 --> 00:01:30.391
This country's very, very divided.

00:01:30.391 --> 00:01:40.920
I do say to the impeachment divide, the further
it continues, the fight is great.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:48.130
That's why I want to reach across the aisle.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:53.270
I want as a president to lead the fight if
that's going to happen.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:59.450
I want to see about as leading advisors sit
him down, make the transition a show that

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:00.450
is to you to keep those statements going to
help you.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.540
I need to talk to Pelosi this week.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:11.530
I hope she calls me today and see if we can
start that process.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:15.370
Speaker 1: This is incredible stuff.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:19.670
I truly hope that's the end of the clip.

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:22.080
This makes these people look way worse.

