00:03:40.959 --> 00:03:42.420
that influence that?

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.599
Is there some connection?

00:03:43.599 --> 00:03:50.310
And we're speculating here between whatever
made Ted Cruz and Lindsey Graham 180 on Trump.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:54.870
Remember, those were not people who ever supported
Trump early and then all of a sudden they

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:55.870
